Initial attempts to predict MIC values of AMPs using conventional sequence encodings and traditional machine learning methods demonstrated limited performance, particularly when applied to spatially structured representations [12, 18]. To overcome these limitations, we employed CGR to convert AMP sequences into 16\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
