To investigate how spatial and physicochemical patterns encoded within the FCGR matrix contribute to MIC prediction, we performed a multi-angle interpretability analysis that integrates motif-level composition mapping, model-derived attention visualization, correlation statistics, motif frequency comparisons, and physicochemical property profiling (Figs 5A–E). The FCGR matrix, derived from the CGR framework [29], represents AMP sequences as a 16\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
